---
import {products,categories,extras,formatMoney} from '../data/menu';
import Icon from '../../../../packages/ui/Icon.astro';
import '../styles/menu.css';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="de"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"/><title>Street Food — Dein digitales Menü</title><meta name="description" content="Burger, Frühstück und Kaffee: Entdecke das interaktive Street-Food-Menü mit Favoriten, Extras und Warenkorb."/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow"/><link rel="canonical" href={new URL(base,Astro.site||'https://girda.github.io')}/><link rel="icon" href={`${base}assets/food.svg`}/></head><body>
<div class="food-app"><header class="app-header"><button class="icon-button" data-menu-open aria-label="Navigation öffnen"><Icon name="menu"/></button><div><a class="wordmark" href={base}>STREET FOOD</a><button class="location-button" data-location-open>Standort auswählen</button></div><button class="icon-button" data-search-open aria-label="Gerichte suchen"><Icon name="search"/></button></header>
<div class="search-bar" hidden><label for="menu-search">Worauf hast du Lust?</label><input id="menu-search" type="search" placeholder="Burger, Croissant, Kaffee …" autocomplete="off"/><button class="icon-button" data-search-close aria-label="Suche schließen"><Icon name="x"/></button></div>
<nav class="categories" aria-label="Menükategorien">{categories.map((c,i)=><button class="category" data-category-select={c.id} aria-pressed={i===0}><span aria-hidden="true">{c.symbol}</span>{c.name}</button>)}</nav>
<main id="main"><div class="menu-caption"><h1>Was darf’s sein?</h1><span data-results>{products.length} Gerichte</span></div><div class="dish-grid">{products.map(p=><article class="dish-card" data-product={p.id} data-category={p.category}><button class="dish-open" data-open={p.id} aria-label={`${p.name}, ${formatMoney(p.price)}, Details und Extras`}><div class="dish-photo"><img src={p.image} data-fallback={`${base}assets/food.svg`} alt={p.name} width="780" height="490" loading="lazy"/><span class="prep-time">{p.time} MIN.</span></div><div class="dish-info"><h2>{p.name}</h2><strong>{formatMoney(p.price)}</strong></div></button><button class="favorite icon-button" data-favorite={p.id} aria-pressed="false" aria-label={`${p.name} merken`}><Icon name="heart"/></button><button class="quick-add" data-add={p.id} aria-label={`${p.name} zum Warenkorb hinzufügen`}><Icon name="plus"/></button></article>)}</div><div class="empty-state" hidden><h2>Hier ist noch Platz.</h2><p data-empty-text>Probiere eine andere Suche oder Kategorie.</p><button class="primary" data-reset>Alle Gerichte ansehen</button></div><p class="demo-note">Interaktive Menü-Demo. Beispielpreise und Rezepturen; Bilder können abweichen. Keine echte Bestellung oder Zahlung. Allergene bitte vor einem echten Kauf beim Betrieb prüfen.</p></main>
<button class="cart-dock" data-cart-open><span><Icon name="shopping-bag"/><span data-cart-label>Dein Warenkorb</span></span><strong data-cart-total>0,00 €</strong></button></div>
<dialog class="food-dialog product-dialog" data-product-dialog aria-labelledby="product-title"><button class="dialog-close icon-button" data-close aria-label="Schließen"><Icon name="x"/></button><img class="product-hero" data-product-image alt=""/><div class="product-detail"><p class="overline" data-product-category></p><div class="product-title-row"><h2 id="product-title"></h2><strong data-product-price></strong></div><p data-product-description></p><p class="allergen-note"><strong>Beispielallergene:</strong> <span data-product-allergens></span></p><fieldset class="extras"><legend>Mach’s zu deinem.</legend>{extras.map(e=><label><input type="checkbox" name="extra" value={e.id}/><span>{e.name}</span><strong>+ {formatMoney(e.price)}</strong></label>)}</fieldset><label class="dish-note">Dein Wunsch<textarea data-dish-note maxlength="180" rows="2" placeholder="Zum Beispiel: ohne Zwiebeln. Bei Allergien bitte persönlich nachfragen."></textarea></label></div><div class="product-actions"><div class="quantity"><button type="button" data-quantity="-1" aria-label="Menge verringern">−</button><output data-quantity-value>1</output><button type="button" data-quantity="1" aria-label="Menge erhöhen">+</button></div><button class="primary" data-product-add>Hinzufügen <span data-add-total></span></button></div></dialog>
<dialog class="food-dialog cart-dialog" data-cart-dialog aria-labelledby="cart-title"><button class="dialog-close icon-button" data-close aria-label="Warenkorb schließen"><Icon name="x"/></button><div class="cart-heading"><p class="overline">GUTE WAHL.</p><h2 id="cart-title">Deine Bestellung.</h2><p data-cart-location>Demo · Abholung</p></div><div data-cart-items></div><div class="cart-summary"><span>Gesamt</span><strong data-summary-total></strong></div><button class="primary checkout" data-checkout>Demo-Bestellung prüfen</button><p class="demo-note">Es wird nichts versendet oder berechnet.</p><div class="order-confirmation" hidden aria-live="polite"><h3>So könnte deine Bestellung aussehen.</h3><p>Diese Vorschau ist lokal. Eine Küche, Zahlung und echte Bestellannahme sind noch nicht angeschlossen.</p></div></dialog>
<dialog class="food-dialog small-dialog" data-location-dialog aria-labelledby="location-title"><button class="dialog-close icon-button" data-close aria-label="Schließen"><Icon name="x"/></button><h2 id="location-title">Wo möchtest du bestellen?</h2><p>Wähle einen Demo-Standort. Deine Auswahl bleibt auf diesem Gerät.</p><button class="location-choice" data-location="Street Food · Altstadt">Street Food · Altstadt<span>Demo · Abholung</span></button><button class="location-choice" data-location="Street Food · Am Park">Street Food · Am Park<span>Demo · Abholung</span></button></dialog>
<dialog class="food-dialog small-dialog" data-nav-dialog aria-labelledby="nav-title"><button class="dialog-close icon-button" data-close aria-label="Schließen"><Icon name="x"/></button><h2 id="nav-title">Street Food.</h2><button class="location-choice" data-nav-category="all">Alle Gerichte</button><button class="location-choice" data-nav-category="favorites">Deine Favoriten</button><p class="demo-note">Ein QR-Menü-Konzept von HIRDA. Kein echter Restaurantbetrieb.</p></dialog>
<div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<script id="menu-data" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify({products,extras})}/><script>import '../scripts/menu';</script></body></html>
